SOC Analyst Lab – End-to-End Security Operations Simulation
Overview

This repository contains hands-on labs and simulations covering core Security Operations Center (SOC) activities including log analysis, threat intelligence, incident response, alert triage, and full attack lifecycle handling.

The project demonstrates practical skills aligned with real-world SOC workflows using tools like Elastic Security, Wazuh, TheHive, VirusTotal, Velociraptor, and Metasploit.

